"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-4324760","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T10:31:08Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4324760,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4324760","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T10:31:08Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4324760,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4324760-1846018067927222","game_id":"steam-4324760","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update Is LIVE","summary":"We’ve been working pretty hard to polish up the demo for Steam Next Fest and we’ve finally achieved some major improvements hence a new and updated demo is finally out.What you can expect from the demo:A lot of known and unknown bugs have been hunted down and crushed (we probably created new ones tho, but that’s ok, we’ll fix it) As promised we’ve added quite a bit new content and quality of life improvements so here’s what’s new: New Content & FeaturesChecklistWe added a checklist to help you k","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T19:13:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927222","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4324760-1843481262691638","game_id":"steam-4324760","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: New Content & Improvements","summary":"It’s been a little over a month since our last update, so first of all, thank you for your patience! We’ve been pretty quiet because we’ve been heavily focused on development, and we’re really happy with how things are coming together. I’m really happy to announce that a new demo update is coming soon, which also means we’re one step closer to the full release.Alongside the previously mentioned updates and fixes, we’ve also added some new features.Here are some of the features we’ve been working","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T09:21:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262691638","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4324760-1840310314341482","game_id":"steam-4324760","kind":"announcement","title":"Shift Report: 1,500 Guests Checked In","summary":"Hello everyone!Here's a quick update on the progress of Room Service. Since releasing the demo, we've reached over 1,500 downloads, and we're incredibly grateful to everyone who took the time to play it. Thank you for all the support and feedback you've shared so far. We're currently working on fixing the reported issues in the demo while continuing development of the full game.When we first announced our plans, we were hoping to release in early summer. As first time developers, we underestimat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T10:43:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314341482","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4324760-1839041357024642","game_id":"steam-4324760","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo is Live","summary":"The wait is finally over! Room Service demo is now available on Steam!You can finally attend your first shift as a Night Shift Attendant at the Silver Pine Hotel. Your duties are simple: inspect the rooms, fill out nightly reports and most importantly... If you see anything move, leave immediately. The demo includes:A complete first shift introducing the hotel’s rules9 handcrafted rooms from the planned 40+ room full gameCore gameplay loop of cleaning, observing and reportingPlenty of unsettling","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-22T17:08:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357024642","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4324760-1837955055356820","game_id":"steam-4324760","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Submitted for Steam Review","summary":"If you know the feeling of anticipation and expectation when it comes to a video game, we can proudly say that the feeling is equal in both waiting for a game to come out AND getting a game ready to come out!We have finally tested our game thoroughly and polished it enough that we deemed it was worthy of submitting the demo to Steam. We’re eagerly waiting for review and soon you’ll be able to play it yourself! And while we are waiting for approval we are eager to share some great news! Sound Des","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-10T13:17:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055356820","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4324760-1835236783561428","game_id":"steam-4324760","kind":"update","title":"1,000 Wishlists Reached + Demo Progress Update","summary":"We’ve officially reached 1,000 wishlists!I still can’t believe it!Thank you all so much for following, supporting, and wishlisting the game. It genuinely means a lot and keeps me pushing every day.We’ve decided to put together a demo so you can experience the horror first hand while we continue polishing the game.The demo is in its final stages as we’re still debating which rooms are the creepiest, but it’s very close.In the demo, you’ll:Clean hotel roomsWatch for anomaliesDecide whether rooms a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-11T18:08:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783561428","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4324760-1832700592791272","game_id":"steam-4324760","kind":"update","title":"Development Update: We're getting close","summary":"Hello! We wanted to share a quick update on where development currently stands. Over the past 8 months, we’ve been working very hard on polishing the game, and we’re finally reaching the final stages of development.Here’s what we’ve been working on recently:Polishing the lobby (literally, I put a very shiny marble floors this time) Out of planned 20 rooms for this project, we now have around 35 out of 43 rooms completed (also my way of saying that we added way more rooms than originally planned)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-15T09:14:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592791272","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4324760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:26Z","status":"ok","all_sources_c